OL,3,GNEWSA#250m transport plan includes cash
OL,4,Ato repair landslips
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #250m plan to improve
OL,7,FWorcestershire's transport network has
OL,8,Fbeen revealed - including money to
OL,9,Frepair two landslips.
OL,11,FWorcestershire County Council has
OL,12,Fearmarked #5m towards repairing the
OL,13,FA449 at British Camp in Malvern, and
OL,14,Fthe B4204 at Rochford, near Tenbury
OL,15,FWells.
OL,17,FBoth landslips have caused major
OL,18,Fproblems among traders, some of whom
OL,19,Fhave called for compensation.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
